      "proposition": "Dagger provides native SDKs for Go, Python, TypeScript, PHP, Java, .NET, Elixir, and Rust.",
      "support": "Line 15 asserts SDKs for 8 languages; line 27 says each SDK is generated from the API schema."
    },
    {
